In the late afternoon, I started the return journey.
At four o'clock, I arrived back at the boat jetty.
I got onto the returning ferry.
There were a lot of people on the boat.
Some sat looking at their own phones.
The evening breeze was very cool.
At five o'clock, I reached the railway station.
I waited for the train to Ernakulam.
My train arrived at six o'clock.
I got onto the train and sat near a window.
I placed my bag on my own lap.
The sun began to set.
There were beautiful colors in the sky.
They shone on the water too.
I rested my head against the window.
I walked a lot today.
My body was very tired.
But, my mind was very happy.
At night, I returned to Kochi.
